{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set in 19th-century Philippines, during the Philippine-American War.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick up your rifle and defend your country from both external and internal threats.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The current version of the game revolves around the Aswang timeline only.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Includes a sandbox duel mode where you can have certain groups fight one another in a simulation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is an early access for our unfinished game,\u00a0Rayadillo. We\u2019re sharing it to build a community and get your feedback on what we\u2019ve been working on for the past 2 years.\u00a0The Early Access will revolve around the aswang storyline, while the history levels are still being planned and in development.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a work of fiction inspired by real historical events and figures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is still in development.<br>Thank you for your support!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2923970?t=1773146697","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2923970/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1773146697","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2923970/83f95aa86760b1d266d3170b0c77ab8e48ba5a2d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773146697","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2923970/83f95aa86760b1d266d3170b0c77ab8e48ba5a2d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773146697","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set in 19th-century Philippines, during the Philippine-American War.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick up your rifle and defend your country from both external and internal threats.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The current version of the game revolves around the Aswang timeline only.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Includes a sandbox duel mode where you can have certain groups fight one another in a simulation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is an early access for our unfinished game,\u00a0Rayadillo. We\u2019re sharing it to build a community and get your feedback on what we\u2019ve been working on for the past 2 years.\u00a0The Early Access will revolve around the aswang storyline, while the history levels are still being planned and in development.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a work of fiction inspired by real historical events and figures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is still in development.<br>Thank you for your support!</p>","developers":["raya"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2923970/header.jpg?t=1773146697","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a9 2026 Rayadillo Games. All rights reserved.","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2923970/1371431811/27ef8243c463f6c53aa107cfdf4f0567b8441648/1771333659/dash_av1.mpd?t=1771334027","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/292397